The tokenized state machine macro generates method signatures like:
- For `transition!{ delay_enter_freeing(page_id, block_id) { ... } }` which removes `delay[page_id]` and adds `delay[page_id]` and adds `delay_actor[page_id]` while having `block[block_id]`:
